WEBVTT

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:24.540
That level of particle emission...

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:25.880
A Burning Burst?!

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:29.550
His stored particles...

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:32.300
He released all of them.

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.100
This is only the beginning.

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:36.220
That's true.

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:43.770
Sekai, you're nothing...

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:48.110
...but a stepping stone to my true strength.

00:01:05.670 --> 00:01:11.090
<i>Our wings couldn't wait for the wind, so we set out</i>

00:01:11.090 --> 00:01:16.550
<i>We were bathed in the light of the frozen sun</i>

00:01:16.550 --> 00:01:19.310
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh there are no limits</i>

00:01:19.310 --> 00:01:22.060
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh just let it go</i>

00:01:22.060 --> 00:01:27.610
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh loneliness won't break us</i>

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:32.150
<i>At the end of the dream we'll never give up,</i>

00:01:32.150 --> 00:01:34.780
<i>Will there be a future that can never end?</i>

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:40.370
<i>Believe in what only you can do</i>

00:01:40.370 --> 00:01:43.120
<i>If I could seize one thing,</i>

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:45.790
<i>I'd choose it without hesitation</i>

00:01:45.790 --> 00:01:51.090
<i>Follow your instincts, just hold on to our bond</i>

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:57.640
Up to the endless sky, now! Fly away

00:02:15.570 --> 00:02:18.990
<i>GUNDAM BUILD FIGHTERS TRY</i>

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:22.990
Episode 20
Unbreakable Heart

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:26.370
<i>Show it to me, Sekai.</i>

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:30.960
Your unique technique
that I don't know.

00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:33.090
Yeah, I'll show it to you.

00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:35.130
Let's go,

00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:36.340
<i>Try Burning!</i>

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:39.300
This is our technique!

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:43.850
The one we found together!

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:47.440
I see.

00:02:47.940 --> 00:02:51.360
<i>ls it like this?!</i>

00:02:54.030 --> 00:02:55.240
What?!
What?!

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:04.120
<i>Sekai!</i>

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:04.870
<i>Sekai!</i>

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:07.710
<i>It's not over!</i>

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:10.040
<i>Yes it is!</i>

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:26.730
<i>ls this the ultimate secret
that the master taught you?</i>

00:03:26.980 --> 00:03:28.020
No!

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:30.980
<i>This technique is one that
Try Burning and I created!</i>

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:33.480
<i>No wonder I could
copy it so easily.</i>

00:03:33.770 --> 00:03:35.230
<i>What did you say?!</i>

00:03:35.230 --> 00:03:37.240
<i>Use it, Sekai.</i>

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:40.160
<i>The ultimate secret of
the Jigen Haoh School!</i>

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:44.240
<i>Once I have it,
I'll get even stronger!</i>

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:46.620
<i>I'll go beyond this.</i>

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:49.120
<i>To the extremes of strength!</i>

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:51.830
<i>You're obsessed with strength!</i>

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:54.590
<i>Same goes for you.</i>

00:03:54.590 --> 00:03:55.550
<i>No.</i>

00:03:55.670 --> 00:03:57.670
<i>The strength that I want...</i>

00:03:57.670 --> 00:04:00.430
<i>...isn't the inner mystery
of Jigen Haoh School!</i>

00:04:01.890 --> 00:04:03.600
<i>Then beat me.</i>

00:04:03.850 --> 00:04:07.560
<i>Win, and deny my way of living!</i>

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:20.950
It's a draw?

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:22.070
No.

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:25.280
The Try Burning's right arm...!

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:53.350
S-Sekai...

00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:54.350
He lost?

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:56.400
<i>Sekai...</i>

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:03.400
<i>You must realize it, Sekai.</i>

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:06.620
<i>Because you don't know anything
beyond the Jigen Haoh School,</i>

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:09.160
this is the limit
of your strength.

00:05:13.670 --> 00:05:14.670
Yuuma.

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:16.250
Hoshino.

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:18.750
Two-on-one, huh?

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:20.670
Okay. Bring it on.

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:22.050
<i>Don't misunderstand!</i>

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:27.260
We're here to keep you
from running <i>away.</i>

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:29.600
<i>What?</i>

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:31.720
Get up, Sekai!

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:33.980
Stand up, Sekai!

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:36.060
Mr. Sei put his soul
into that Gunpla.

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:37.860
Use your fist,

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:41.030
<i>and straighten out
that misguided man!</i>

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:43.950
Right.

00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:46.070
I haven't...

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:47.700
...done it yet.

00:05:49.330 --> 00:05:50.030
<i>What?</i>

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:52.950
Haven't... told him.

00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:59.750
I can't believe he stood up
in his condition.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:02.340
But even if he stands up...

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:05.760
ls there any chance of winning?

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:09.720
<i>I have to hand it to you, Sekai.</i>

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:16.350
Even when you're losing you fight fair,
giving your all 'til the very end.

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:20.900
Exactly as the teachings
of the Jigen Haoh School say.

00:06:22.780 --> 00:06:23.780
<i>Really...</i>

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:25.990
<i>How you disgust me!</i>

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:33.580
That's unfair!

00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:35.580
But this is Gunpla Battle.

00:06:35.710 --> 00:06:37.750
It's Vale Tudo. Anything goes!

00:06:37.920 --> 00:06:41.210
Therefore, one could say
it's a skillful tactic.

00:06:41.790 --> 00:06:42.960
Do you like it?

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:45.090
Not at all!

00:06:48.930 --> 00:06:51.220
<i>I guess you don't like
unfair techniques.</i>

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:54.770
You should try them.

00:06:54.770 --> 00:06:56.730
If you do, you can get stronger!

00:06:57.270 --> 00:06:58.810
Much, much stronger...

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:00.940
<i>...than you are now!</i>

00:07:02.770 --> 00:07:03.270
Sekai!

00:07:03.570 --> 00:07:04.280
Sekai!

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:05.610
Sekai!

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:06.950
Sekai!

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:09.740
<i>Stop the Assimilation!</i>

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:15.120
But he can't stop it.

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:20.330
As long as the fighter wants to fight,
and the Gunpla can respond...

00:07:20.420 --> 00:07:21.960
Or vice versa.

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:25.710
Yes. As long as the Gunpla can move,

00:07:26.260 --> 00:07:28.510
the fighter won't stop fighting!

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:29.970
Then".

00:07:30.180 --> 00:07:32.430
<i>...take this!</i>

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:54.870
<i>I'm sorry...</i>

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:57.580
<i>...Try Burning.</i>

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:01.920
<i>If I had been stronger...</i>

00:08:03.290 --> 00:08:07.050
<i>...you wouldn't have
taken so much damage.</i>

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:09.420
<i>So...</i>

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:12.340
<i>I won't fight...</i>

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:15.720
<i>...anymore...</i>

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:20.440
<i>This is...</i>

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:34.780
<i>Wh... What?!</i>

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:36.870
Huh? What's this glow?!

00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:39.910
It's emitting particles
directly from storage...!

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:43.830
ls that the RG's core unit?

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:46.630
He still has that many particles?

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:49.710
Sekai's Gunpla...

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:52.220
It's beautiful.

00:08:57.390 --> 00:09:00.220
<i>You still can move, Try Burning?</i>

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:03.640
<i>Will you still...</i>

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:06.060
<i>Will you still fight with me?</i>

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:22.160
Then".

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:24.870
I'll fight, too!

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:28.170
<i>Give it up already!</i>

00:09:32.220 --> 00:09:35.090
<i>Try Burning's feelings, and mine.</i>

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:36.640
<i>Our everything.</i>

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:39.220
Sekai!!

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:41.930
We'll put them...

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:45.100
...into this fist!!

00:09:53.110 --> 00:09:54.200
<i>ls that it?!</i>

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:01.450
<i>(Holy Fist)
Seiken!</i>

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:03.160
<i>(Gale Force)
Shippu!</i>

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:04.870
<i>(Blue Sky)
Soten!</i>

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:06.370
<i>(Crushing Stone)
Hagan!</i>

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:08.210
<i>(Flashing)
Senko"...</i>

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:14.970
<i>(Shooting Star Burst)
...Ryusei Reppaku!!</i>

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:22.220
<i>Th-This technique...</i>

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:28.020
<i>Combining the Jigen Haoh
School with Gunpla Battle...</i>

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:33.900
<i>It's not like the strength I got
from absorbing other martial arts.</i>

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:38.990
<i>It's like a builder building
a Gunpla in his own style.</i>

00:10:40.830 --> 00:10:44.160
<i>Sekai's been trying to create...</i>

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:46.750
<i>...his own unique strength.</i>

00:11:45.810 --> 00:11:47.560
<i>Battle ended.</i>

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:54.230
<i>In the quarterfinals of the Gunpla
Battle Japanese Championship,</i>

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:54.520
<i>Tenzan Academy Seiho Academy</i>
<i>In the quarterfinals of the Gunpla
Battle Japanese Championship,</i>

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:55.070
Tenzan Academy Seiho Academy

00:11:55.070 --> 00:11:56.860
<i>Tenzan Academy Seiho Academy
the winner of match three is...</i>

00:11:57.610 --> 00:11:59.610
<i>Seiho Academy</i>
<i>Seiho Academy Middle School,
team Try Fighters!</i>

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:01.950
<i>Seiho Academy Middle School,
team Try Fighters!</i>

00:12:06.790 --> 00:12:08.040
Sekai...

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:10.370
Sekai, are you alright?

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:12.710
Y-Yeah, I'm fine.

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:14.130
Hoshino.

00:12:14.210 --> 00:12:15.380
Yuuma.

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:17.670
I'm grateful.

00:12:17.760 --> 00:12:20.050
You let me fight
one-on-one with Jun.

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:21.550
Not at all.

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:23.050
But l...

00:12:23.050 --> 00:12:25.470
I broke the Try Burning again.

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:26.600
Don't worry.

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:29.640
I'll work hard to fix it.

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:32.560
And you fought such a great battle...

00:12:33.060 --> 00:12:35.020
I'm sure Mr. Sei is happy.

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:39.400
Big Sis.

00:12:39.740 --> 00:12:40.740
What is it?

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:43.070
My fist...

00:12:43.740 --> 00:12:45.490
Do you think it reached Jun?

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:49.620
Yes, I'm sure it did.

00:12:58.920 --> 00:12:59.960
Sekai.

00:13:01.970 --> 00:13:03.760
Sekai Kamiki.

00:13:08.060 --> 00:13:09.770
Why are you sitting?!

00:13:09.770 --> 00:13:11.640
You're the winner. Stand tall!

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:14.560
J-Jun...

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:18.770
Your fist struck home with me.

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:22.190
Don't lose, okay?

00:13:22.530 --> 00:13:23.240
Bye.

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:28.830
The reason the master didn't
teach me the ultimate secret...

00:13:28.830 --> 00:13:30.370
I finally understand.

00:13:30.450 --> 00:13:31.500
Junya...

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:36.080
None of Jigen Haoh's techniques
are an "ultimate secret."

00:13:38.340 --> 00:13:40.920
That's the ultimate secret.

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:45.010
Oh, boy.

00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:48.600
The pursuit really is endless...

00:13:48.600 --> 00:13:51.020
...when you're searching
for ultimate strength.

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:53.980
Jun!

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:55.640
Will I ever see you again?

00:13:59.270 --> 00:14:00.690
Jun...

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:04.240
Don't worry. I'm certain you'll meet again.

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:07.820
Because your fist has...

00:14:07.820 --> 00:14:10.870
...engraved itself in his heart.

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:17.460
Yeah. Someday, for sure.

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:21.630
After a 30-minute intermission,

00:14:21.630 --> 00:14:24.470
we'll begin match four of the quarterfinals.

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:34.560
Akira Suga.

00:14:34.980 --> 00:14:37.850
Aren't you going to watch
the rest of the matches?

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:42.730
Isn't Gunpla Battle
for playing, not watching?

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:44.990
You're right.

00:14:44.990 --> 00:14:47.200
Hop in. I'll take you to the station.

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:53.990
So you were beaten magnificently.

00:14:53.990 --> 00:14:55.160
Right.

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:56.660
Just as you said.

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:01.840
Sekai still had something I'd lost.

00:15:02.550 --> 00:15:06.550
The pure and earnest will
to keep growing stronger.

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:11.850
I'll start over from the beginning.

00:15:15.470 --> 00:15:16.390
Hey.

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:19.650
Why don't we go play
Gunpla Battle somewhere?

00:15:19.650 --> 00:15:22.440
What's this, all of a sudden? I only just-

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:23.940
Let's play.

00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:25.860
The way you are now, it might be fun.

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:27.240
The way you are now, it might be fun.

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:35.080
<i>I wanna know where the rainbow's coming from</i>

00:15:28.740 --> 00:15:30.450
Yeah.

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:31.910
That may be true.

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:38.080
By the way, when did you
get your driver's license?

00:15:38.460 --> 00:15:39.120
Two days ago.

00:15:39.210 --> 00:15:40.040
What?!

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:43.000
Stop! I'm getting out!

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:46.090
Don't say that.
Nobody wants to ride with me!

00:15:46.170 --> 00:15:47.760
Let me out!!

00:15:52.140 --> 00:15:54.430
<i>Thank you for waiting.</i>

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:58.430
<i>We now begin match four
in the quarterfinals...</i>

00:15:58.600 --> 00:15:58.850
...of <i>the Gunpla Battle
Japanese Championship.</i>

00:15:58.850 --> 00:16:01.100
Granada Academy Gabai Institute

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:04.610
<i>Gabai Institute,
representing Kagoshima,</i>

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:06.440
<i>team White Wolf versus...</i>

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:09.780
<i>...Granada Academy,
representing Tokushima,</i>

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:12.620
<i>team Von Braun.</i>

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:19.460
I said I'd keep you in reserve
until we fight the Gunpla Academy.

00:16:19.540 --> 00:16:21.750
Why did you suddenly
volunteer to play?

00:16:23.630 --> 00:16:25.590
The Try Burning Gundam.

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:27.510
Sekai Kamiki.

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:32.640
Watching a battle like that
would fire up anyone's blood.

00:16:34.140 --> 00:16:37.720
I changed the fighter and machine entries.

00:16:37.890 --> 00:16:39.600
But keep your guard up.

00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:41.560
Gabai Institute is strong.

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:45.360
They've played in the National
Tournament four years in a row.

00:16:45.810 --> 00:16:47.070
Please don't worry.

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:53.070
I threw away such childish
sentiments seven years ago.

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:56.410
Chief Allan!

00:16:56.580 --> 00:16:57.910
That's "Coach."

00:16:58.040 --> 00:17:00.000
The European junior champ
has just showed up!

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:01.160
What?!

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:02.830
It's no mistake!

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:05.670
Yanai, gather the team
members at once.

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:06.500
Understood.

00:17:06.840 --> 00:17:08.590
I'll make a 12K video recording.

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:09.670
Go ahead.

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:13.010
Lucas Nemesis.

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:14.760
Finally, he's appeared.

00:17:17.220 --> 00:17:20.020
They entered the
7th World Championship....

00:17:20.020 --> 00:17:22.520
Led by Aila Jyrkiainen,

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:26.190
team Nemesis advanced
as far as the best four.

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:30.780
To think, the chairman's grandson...

00:17:30.780 --> 00:17:35.110
...has grown up to be strong
enough to conquer Europe.

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:39.160
Granada has changed its members.

00:17:39.330 --> 00:17:42.660
ls that him? The rumored
exchange student helper?

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:45.120
He shouldn't get too cocky.

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:47.670
Japan is the homeland of Gunpla.

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:51.130
We'll show him our Kyushu spirit.
Right, Koshiba?

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:52.460
Yeah, man!

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:57.050
<i>Gunpla Battle, combat mode, startup.</i>

00:17:57.050 --> 00:17:59.970
<i>Model damage level, set to A.</i>

00:18:00.560 --> 00:18:02.560
Please set your GP Base.

00:18:03.980 --> 00:18:06.980
<i>Beginning Plavsky particle dispersal.</i>

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:11.480
<i>Field 1, Space.</i>

00:18:11.900 --> 00:18:13.780
Please set your Gunpla.

00:18:16.490 --> 00:18:17.820
<i>Battle start.</i>

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:23.790
Team White Wolf
will devour its prey!

00:18:29.630 --> 00:18:31.420
We'll go around from
the bottom of the colony.

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:33.510
Formation Omega two.

00:18:33.590 --> 00:18:34.630
<i>Rogen
Rogen.</i>

00:18:36.930 --> 00:18:41.510
Now, where will they come from?
Outside the colony? Or inside?

00:18:42.260 --> 00:18:43.270
<i>Matsunaga!</i>

00:18:46.230 --> 00:18:47.140
That's...

00:19:02.580 --> 00:19:07.000
...the Crossbone Gundam X1 Full Cloth!

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:12.630
ls that an l-field?

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:19.090
Lucas Nemesis.

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:23.310
Commencing scenario.

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:29.940
I'm full!

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:32.150
Thank you for feeding me.

00:19:32.360 --> 00:19:35.440
I hadn't eaten because I was
being treated in the infirmary.

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:37.900
You know, in today's battle,

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:40.990
that last technique was really awesome.

00:20:04.010 --> 00:20:06.680
To be honest, I almost gave up.

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:11.150
But the Try Burning cheered me on.

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:13.230
The Try Burning did?

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:14.440
What do you mean?

00:20:14.440 --> 00:20:17.150
Well, it just felt that way.

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:20.650
I have to go and help Yuuma.

00:20:21.200 --> 00:20:23.820
Go ahead. I'll clean this up for you.

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:26.740
Thanks! I appreciate the offer.

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:27.620
Bye!

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:28.500
Yeah.

00:20:38.760 --> 00:20:39.880
Excuse me.

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:43.550
How's your injury?

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:44.550
Huh?

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:46.260
Are you fully healed?

00:20:47.560 --> 00:20:49.810
Um... Yeah, I'm fine.

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:52.230
That's good.

00:20:53.440 --> 00:20:54.560
Thanks.

00:20:55.810 --> 00:20:56.940
<i>Who's he?</i>

00:20:59.110 --> 00:21:00.490
With you...

00:21:00.740 --> 00:21:01.610
Huh?

00:21:02.910 --> 00:21:05.240
...l think I can battle in earnest.

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:13.830
What's with him?

00:21:13.920 --> 00:21:16.540
But, my whole body...

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:19.380
All my senses are telling me...

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:24.510
That guy"-

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:26.890
He's something else.

00:21:34.900 --> 00:21:37.940
<i>There's a tomorrow I want to touch</i>

00:21:37.940 --> 00:21:41.320
<i>I want to prove it for myself</i>

00:21:41.320 --> 00:21:46.110
<i>Love, hate, which is it?</i>

00:21:46.910 --> 00:21:49.950
<i>Perhaps the challenge is in the journey</i>

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:53.080
<i>Wandering the unknown path...</i>

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:59.800
<i>...toward abundant happiness</i>

00:22:01.590 --> 00:22:04.550
<i>I was afraid to run</i>

00:22:04.550 --> 00:22:07.970
<i>But now that I've started, I can't stop</i>

00:22:07.970 --> 00:22:10.760
<i>I must've been waiting for the go sign</i>

00:22:10.760 --> 00:22:14.600
<i>With this passion in my impatient heart,</i>

00:22:14.600 --> 00:22:19.270
<i>I want to search for something</i>

00:22:19.270 --> 00:22:23.990
<i>Let's meet over and over again (with you)</i>

00:22:23.990 --> 00:22:26.320
<i>On this journey, can you show me...</i>

00:22:26.320 --> 00:22:31.330
...a <i>different truth? (let me see)</i>

00:22:31.330 --> 00:22:38.290
<i>The power to find new things (with me)</i>

00:22:38.290 --> 00:22:41.840
<i>Never forget it</i>

00:22:41.840 --> 00:22:44.170
<i>Bring the real you to meet the real me</i>

00:22:44.170 --> 00:22:44.670
<i>(Today)
Bring the real you to meet the real me</i>

00:22:44.670 --> 00:22:46.340
<i>(Today)
As we travel, you smile at me</i>

00:22:46.340 --> 00:22:47.180
<i>(I'll be there...)
As we travel, you smile at me</i>

00:22:47.180 --> 00:22:50.140
<i>(I'll be there...)
I love it, I love it, this journey without a compass</i>

00:22:50.140 --> 00:22:52.560
<i>(Alive!)
I love it, I love it, this journey without a compass</i>

00:22:52.560 --> 00:22:53.520
<i>(Alive!)</i>

00:22:53.560 --> 00:22:59.480
Team Try Fighters!

00:23:01.480 --> 00:23:02.650
Sorry I'm late.

00:23:02.940 --> 00:23:05.110
I'll help with that right-

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:07.650
Sekai.

00:23:07.860 --> 00:23:09.990
Gabai Institute lost.

00:23:10.910 --> 00:23:11.910
Gabai Institute did?

00:23:12.990 --> 00:23:15.450
What great strength.

00:23:16.200 --> 00:23:18.670
It's not just his fighting style...

00:23:18.670 --> 00:23:20.880
He's a top-level builder, too.

00:23:21.210 --> 00:23:24.210
This really is a big world...!

00:23:28.840 --> 00:23:32.390
He's the European champ,
all right. It's not just for show.

00:23:32.720 --> 00:23:35.850
He's strong enough to push back Axis.

00:23:35.850 --> 00:23:38.390
Mr. Adou, this is no laughing matter.

00:23:40.270 --> 00:23:41.400
Right.

00:23:41.560 --> 00:23:43.940
I haven't felt a chill
like this for a long time.

00:23:44.650 --> 00:23:47.150
It's only being honest to say it...

00:23:48.400 --> 00:23:51.160
The greatest Gunpla
in this tournament is...

00:23:52.370 --> 00:23:55.080
...this Full Cloth.

00:24:00.580 --> 00:24:02.250
Match One of the semifinals.

00:24:02.250 --> 00:24:03.340
The Gunpla Academy...

00:24:03.340 --> 00:24:05.630
...and the European champ
begin their grueling battle.

00:24:05.630 --> 00:24:06.420
Next episode, "Blue Wings".

00:24:06.420 --> 00:24:07.340
Blue Wings
Next episode, "Blue Wings".

00:24:07.340 --> 00:24:07.590
Blue Wings

00:24:07.590 --> 00:24:09.800
Blue Wings
The Gunpla Academy's losing?
